  {"name":"Basket","target":"🧺 Basket","result":"The ball settles inside and the basket visibly holds it.","simple":"A wide target and forgiving snap make placement easy.","explore":"Sort or carry several toys as part of a pretend cleanup game.","change":"Loose ball → basket contents","next":"Take it out or carry the basket."},
